description	"Sith Lord X1

Weaponry:
Fists
Lightsaber (Defense 3; Yellow, Red, Blue styles)

Force Powers:
Push 3
Jump 3
Sense 3
Lightning 3
Saber Throw 3
Team Heal 2
Deflect 3

Attributes:
Self Heal 3
Saber resistance
Strong against melee
BP free jumps
Can deflect during swings


X1, along with his brother X2, was a force-sensitive clone trooper of the Galactic Republic, secretly created from Jedi Knight Falon Grey's DNA. 
Shortly after the creation of the Empire and his brother's defection, X1 led an attack on Falon Grey's hiding place on Dantooine, eventually killing him and leaving his brother X2 for dead.
X1 then served the Empire for many years, while at the same time gaining knowledge about the dark side of the Force.
After Empire's destruction X1 proclaimed himself a Sith Lord and became one of the many Imperial warlords fighting for control of the shattered Empire."
